vFM Player - MIDI banks

SD folder: /vFM/midi/banks

Copy the complete banks tree, including the ADPCM sample folders. BNK/BNK.GZ files are instrument resources, not music tracks. midi.ini references these files. The original bank and sample rights remain with their authors; see /vFM/licenses.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/midi/banks

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
